.SS Abstract
These defines indicate the bit\-width supported or used by the system.
.PP
\f[CR]__SYSTEM__BIT__\f[R] is a macro that evaluates to the number of
bits of the target architecture\-typically \f[CR]8\f[R], \f[CR]16\f[R],
\f[CR]32\f[R], or \f[CR]64\f[R]\-based on the CPU or compiler settings.
